abstract: >-
  Frozen replication package for a labelled empirical study of public GitHub
  repositories retrieved by AI-instruction filename and path searches within one
  eligible labelled frame. Includes mining outputs, worksheets, analysis scripts,
  codebook, and protocols accompanying the PeerJ Computer Science manuscript.
